lines+=['',s['validation']['parent_candidate_scope'],'','Both parent and candidate execute the complete 19-test Engine planner inventory, including both new borrowed-versus-owned cases. Coverage includes source nodes 0/37, actual scratch owners, current payload sizes 0/13/511, unrelated-node facts, distinct published footprints, finite violations, missing-witness versus overflow precedence, unchanged original templates and retry. Parent uses exact R66 production plus a test-only shim exposing the former owned adapter. Candidate uses the actual borrowed adapter.','', 'Engine and its Compute/Stdlib/Runtime/GPU dependents were rebuilt coherently at opt-level 3 with warnings-as-errors and their retained feature sets. Core/math/syntax/external libraries remain frozen by hash. The fresh Engine tests use their archived broader feature list at opt-level 0; GPU units use the retained opt-level 1 configuration. Scalar release controls retain the unchanged 1.05 ceiling. Exact commands, flags and dependencies are in each build receipt. These are local executions, not a claim of minimal-profile or completed hosted CI. The ordinary Engine owner profile schedules the new tests through its existing unfiltered `--lib` selection.','', 'Failures and corrections:']
