lines+=['', '## Preserved workload and remaining structural work','', 'Full eight-byte level-12 compression of `abcdefgh`, exact raw output `[75,76,74,78,73,77,75,207,0,0]` and independent inflate. Output capacity 13 is cleared/reused. Real buffers remain 262,144 U16 tree entries, 1,500,513 U32 cache words and 305,257 U64 path capacity; depth 300, nice length 258. The pinned source, bytecode, source allocation sites, allocator, input aliases and evaluate_into timing are unchanged. Logical work 60,260,219,686 and comparison work 47,612 are accounting, not hardware instructions. Final managed bytes/nodes are zero.','', 'R66 already removed the first-change immutable-to-private round trip and demonstrated a zero allocation slope within the real reserved buffer capacities. R67 does not relabel that historical evidence as a fresh test. Further work remains to stage invariant binding/plan structure, extend private ownership across genuinely unobserved handoffs, reuse sequential owner workspace and identify the required consumer of every remaining canonical materialization. Current-account authority and finite checks must stay invocation-local.','', '```json',json.dumps(s['source_pins'],indent=2),'```','', 'Decision: **'+s['decision']['status']+'**. '+s['decision']['reason'],'', '## Standalone replay','', 'Run `python3 reconstruct.py /new/empty/output/path` from this packet. Replay verifies every archived version and reproduces scorecard JSON/CSV, census comparison, allocation mechanism, host-assembly comparison, profiles and validation from raw receipts, without compiling or executing a compressor. No scratch directory is needed.','', 'This result does not establish larger-input throughput, allocation parity or standalone minimum memory. No earlier-round gains are multiplied into these measurements.','']
